# ── WhatsApp chat exports — NEVER commit these ───────────────────────────────
# A real group export (whatsapp/Meat_Whatsapp.txt — a ZIP despite the .txt name)
# sat in this PUBLIC repo from 2026-08-01 to 2026-08-16: 693 KB of one group's
# messages, hundreds of senders, phone numbers. None of those people consented
# to publication. It was purged from history with git-filter-repo on 2026-08-16.
#
# The app never needed it committed: it LISTS the folder over the GitHub contents
# API at runtime (5f.7), and where GitHub is unreachable chats travel through
# Firestore instead (5f.8). A committed export is pure exposure, no benefit.
#
# index.json stays tracked on purpose — it holds only group LABELS, no messages.
whatsapp/*.txt
whatsapp/*.zip
